<title>USA: Delphi Funding LLC sells $100 mln cap securities.</title>
<headline>Delphi Funding LLC sells $100 mln cap securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of capital securities from Delphi Funding LLC was priced on Thursday, according to sole manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>BORROWER DELPHI FUNDING LLC</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 9.31 PCT   MATURITY 3/25/2027</p>
<p>TYPE CAPITAL SECS  ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 9/25/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BA2   YIELD 9.31	  PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-MINUS SPREAD 225 BPS    CALLABLE  NON-CALL 10</p>
<p>NOTE: PRICED OVER OLD 30-YEAR BOND</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1678))</p>
